:: Street killer - group won [Place bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">STREETS</h1>
<br />
<center>
    <<image 'places/underground/street_killer_group_won.jpg'>>
</center>
<br /><br />
Both of them were down. One wasn't getting back up. The other was conscious, barely, hands raised — more reflex than surrender.
<br /><br />
<<newguy>>
<<set $tmpGuy.name = either('Vorn', 'Cass', 'Drek', 'Sutter', 'Bale', 'Rook')>>
<<set $tmpGuy.strength = randomInteger(10, 25)>>
<<set $tmpGuy.loyal = false>>
<<sayNpc $tmpGuy>>
    Alright — alright. Just don't —
<</sayNpc>>
<br />
He couldn't finish the sentence.
<br /><br />
<<unset $game.streetsKilledNpc>>
<div id="skgw_kill_block">
<<linkreplace 'Kill him'>>
    <<set _skgwName = $tmpGuy.name>>
    <<unset $tmpGuy>>
    <<run $('#skgw_take_block').hide()>>
    You didn't leave him with a choice. Neither had he.
    <br /><br />
    <<link 'Leave'>>
        <<goto 'Underground city'>>
    <</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="skgw_take_block">
<<linkreplace 'Take him'>>
    <<run setup.npc.addHistory($tmpGuy, 'enslaved', { reason: 'street_murder' })>>
    <<run $slaves.push($tmpGuy)>>
    <<unset $tmpGuy>>
    <<run $('#skgw_kill_block').hide()>>
    You hauled him up by the collar. He came without a fight — which somehow made it worse.
    <br /><br />
    <<link 'Head home'>>
        <<goto 'Underground city'>>
    <</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
